  "body_html": "<h1>unanimous_strict_pref_not_chosen</h1>\n<h2>Lean type</h2>\n<p><code>lean\ntheorem unanimous_strict_pref_not_chosen [Fintype N] [Nonempty N] [Fintype A] (f : VotingRule N A) (hU : Unanimity f) (_hM : Monotonicity f) (P : Profile N A) {a b : A} (hab : ∀ i : N, Prefers P i a b) : b ∉ f P</code></p>\n<h2>Dependencies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>VotingRule</li>\n<li>Unanimity</li>\n<li>Monotonicity</li>\n<li>Profile</li>\n<li>Prefers</li>\n</ul>",
